1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,480
Celestials

25
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,880
are too weak !

26
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,560
Noooo !!!

27
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,580
Between Life and Death,

28
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,360
fate plays tricks on us.

29
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,520
My name is not Ting'er.

30
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,480
However,

31
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,600
this name, Ting'er,

32
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,920
I like it very much.

33
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,880
I die, you live...

34
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:43,600
I live, you die...

35
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,760
Don't tell me that this is our destiny !

36
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,080
No !

37
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,560
Life and Death

38
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,440
are separated by a thin line.

39
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Death

40
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:03,240
is not always the end

41
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,680
because you can be reborn

42
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,800
in someone else's heart.

43
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,440
Life and Death

44
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,720
are the basis of the reincarnation cycle.

45
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,760
The flow of Life and Death

46
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,560
really does mess with people.

47
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,840
What's wrong with his domain ?

48
00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,400
He's really making a breakthrough

49
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,720
in such a place ?

50
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,510
My Life and Death Domain underwent a breakthrough.

51
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,480
Middle stage Soul Formation

52
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,360
is just a step away.

53
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,480
Let's see how long you can hold on

54
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,720
before you run out of celestial spiritual energy !

55
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,720
The celestial swords

56
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,440
are mine !

57
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,920
Ling...

58
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,480
Tian...

59
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,000
hou !!!

60
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,320
Senior Zhou Yi's Sword Spirit

61
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,920
feels like it could destroy everything.

62
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,160
The Celestial is dead.

63
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,880
A mere Sword Spirit

64
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:21,600
dares to try to stop me !?

65
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:32,040
This Sword Spirit has a high cultivation,

66
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:34,280
the strength he can display

67
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,280
is that of a Celestial.

68
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,840
I have been injured so I can't use my full power.

69
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,720
Forget it.

70
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,480
Ting'er is dead...

71
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,720
I won't let you survive !

72
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,320
Are you

73
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:17,880
willing to help me ?

74
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,880
My wife

75
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:23,840
needs 1000 celestial jades every 1000 years to sustain her body.

76
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,000
2 Rain Celestial Swords...

77
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,720
such precious artifacts !

78
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:45,720
Zhuang Yi\NHun Yuan Sect\NEarly stage Soul Formation

79
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,920
Fellow cultivator,

80
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,960
if you give me one

81
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,480
of your celestial swords,

82
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:52,240
the eight of us from the Hun Yuan Sect will protect you.

83
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,000
What do you think ?

84
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,360
The Hun Yuan Sect is trash !

85
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,400
Fellow cultivator,

86
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,480
if you give me a celestial sword,

87
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,040
my Sky Devil Sect

88
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,240
will ensure your safety !

89
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:03,160
Nie Ming\NSky Devil Sect\NEarly stage Soul Formation

90
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,120
3 Late stage Soul Formation,

91
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,160
8 Middle stage Soul Formation,

92
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,600
and the rest are the Early stage Soul Formation...

93
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,480
These 2 celestial swords

94
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,920
belong to my Heaven and Earth Sect !

95
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:16,240
Lu Tianrui\NHeaven and Earth Sect\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

96
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,960
I can't back down now.

97
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,440
If I try to retreat,

98
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:22,120
I will be in a lot of danger.

99
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,160
An Early stage Soul Formation

100
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,400
dares to display his domain in front of me ?

101
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,240
You’re courting death!

102
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,320
What is Life ?

103
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,480
I lost my five senses...

104
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,760
What kind of domain is this !?

105
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,280
Domain...

106
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,040
activate !

107
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:57,200
Lu Tianrui's domain\NFilial Piety

108
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,760
Let's compare our domains,

109
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,240
I'm not afraid of you !

110
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,840
It's rare to see someone reach Soul Formation

111
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,360
through filial piety.

112
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,040
What is Death ?

113
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,360
What kind of domain is this !?

114
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:28,840
Why does this black and white painting shake my heart ?!

115
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:31,800
This is the Life and Death reincarnation cycle !

116
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:43,400
Although my cultivation is at Early stage Soul Formation,

117
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:46,640
my domain was able to reach Middle stage just now.

118
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,920
Now that my Life and Death Domain has reached the second stage,

119
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,320
I would even dare to fight Red Butterfly.

120
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,600
As for you...

121
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,200
He crushed his Origin Soul ?!

122
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:02,400
He killed a Soul Formation cultivator just like that ?

123
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,520
We are outnumbered,

124
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,840
if they fight to the death for the celestial swords,

125
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,520
I'm afraid we won't be able to win.

126
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,680
Your domain might be powerful

127
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,800
but fellow cultivator is alone !

128
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:20,360
You can't protect the celestial swords !

129
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,320
Let's see

130
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,160
who will win this fight.

131
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,560
Hun Yuan Sect,

132
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:28,240
go !

133
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,880
Sky Devil Sect,

134
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:30,720
this is an order.

135
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:32,080
Steal the sword

136
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,440
at all costs !

137
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,280
Kill him !

138
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,360
I can't be blamed for this,

139
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,080
they are just envious of my treasures.

140
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,520
If they don't value their lives,

141
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:46,080
then they're not worth much.

142
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,080
You

143
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,640
are still not showing yourself ?

144
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,320
Could it be...

145
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,680
A Soul Transformation Senior ?

146
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,720
You knew I was here ?

147
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,480
Of course I knew,

148
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,440
you followed me

149
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,080
the entire way.

150
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,520
The Corpse Sect ?!

151
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,200
Little guy, how about we make a deal ?

152
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,120
I’ll help you kill these guys

153
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,680
and you give me 1000 years of freedom.

154
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,760
In these 1000 years,

155
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,320
I won’t look for you

156
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:49,600
and you won’t crush my Origin Soul for no reason.

157
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,520
What do you think ?

158
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,600
Senior wants to have nothing to do with me from now on.

159
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:56,880
But 1000 years is too long.

160
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,120
Besides,

161
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:02,720
what if I die within 1000 years ?

162
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,760
Zhou Yi !

163
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,400
You really tricked me !

164
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,600
If he doesn’t even live for 1000 years,

165
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:13,960
then my Origin Soul

166
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,880
will die with him !

167
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,560
Hurry up, retreat !

168
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:30,120
If I let a single one escape,

169
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,080
word of this will get out

170
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,520
and he won't be safe.

171
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,800
Sky Devil Sect, retreat !

172
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,080
Die...

173
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,280
Retreat, quick !

174
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,040
Retreat !

175
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,600
Let's go !

176
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,440
It's too late...

177
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,960
In front of a Soul Transformation,

178
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,720
Soul Formation cultivators are powerless.

179
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:05,880
Not him.

180
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,120
In these 1000 years,

181
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,520
I will protect you once.

182
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,520
You better stay alive for me !

183
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:33,040
Brother Chi Hu,

184
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:33,920
hop on.

185
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,600
Let's go back to planet Suzaku.

186
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,760
I really gained a lot

187
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:46,120
from this trip to the Celestial Realm.

188
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,240
I didn't expect to meet Senior All-Seer

189
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:50,840
and the Ancestor of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

190
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,960
The cultivation of these old monsters is too high.

191
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:56,520
Fortunately, no one knows where the celestial swords have gone

192
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,920
apart from Chi Hu and Sun Tai.

193
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,920
Thank you for sparing me,

194
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,360
I will remember it.

195
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,120
Don't worry Brother Ceng,

196
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,480
I won't tell anyone

197
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,800
about what happened today.

198
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:10,800
I, Chi Hu,

199
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,640
swear upon my Giant Demon Clan !

200
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,720
Red Butterfly was reckless

201
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,800
so I cut off one of her arms.

202
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:19,320
I'm sure the country of Suzaku won't let that slide.

203
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,920
If you are asked...

204
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,320
Given her behavior,

205
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:24,320
I would have done the same as you.

206
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:26,040
I can't blame Brother Ceng.

207
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,360
Brother Chi Hu,

208
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,680
let us meet again back on Suzaku.

209
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,400
Brother Ceng,

210
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,600
if you have the chance,

211
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,960
come to the Giant Demon Clan.

212
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,440
So we can have a drink together.

213
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,200
Goodbye.

214
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,360
5 months ago,

215
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:01,080
the proud daughter of the heavens lost an arm.

216
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,120
The news of her panicked return to Suzaku

217
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,280
spread like wildfire.

218
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:06,880
Overnight,

219
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,480
Ceng Niu's name

220
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,520
was heard throughout the planet.

221
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:13,200
Rumors about Ceng Niu became a popular topic among cultivators.

222
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:16,280
Many people regarded Ceng Niu

223
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,840
as the star of the new generation.

224
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,880
That was until 3 days ago,

225
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:23,520
when the young master of the Giant Demon Clan returned.

226
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:27,680
Suzaku's Envoy immediately summoned Chi Hu

227
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:27,000
Altar of Mount Suzaku\NCountry of Suzaku

228
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,680
to investigate this matter.

229
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,000
Lord Envoy,

230
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,880
I don't know his true name.

231
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,960
I only know him as Ceng Niu.

232
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,400
His cultivation is unfathomable.

233
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:38,560
Feng Yushan\NHeavenly Jade Sect disciple\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation

234
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,800
Please Lord Envoy,

235
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:41,120
the records of the whole Ceng family are here.

236
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:43,400
There is indeed such a name in the country of Tianhun.

237
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,440
But that Ceng Niu

238
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,400
is only a Foundation Establishment cultivator !

239
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,280
His name has been usurped !

240
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:49,920
Please understand, Lord Envoy !

241
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,560
In this jade

242
00:14:53,090 --> 00:14:54,840
is Ceng Niu's appearance.

243
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,320
From now on,

244
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,600
if you find this person,

245
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,000
you must kill him.

246
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,080
Those who cover up for him

247
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:06,240
will have their whole country buried with them !

248
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,600
You mustn't look for Ceng Niu.

249
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:22,680
Disciple

250
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,160
obeys !

251
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,760
We obey your order.

252
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,480
The Elders of Mount Suzaku banned the search order...

253
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,400
This Ceng Niu...

254
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,280
who the hell is he ?

255
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,400
Ceng Niu,

256
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:46,240
our battle is not over.

257
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,000
I’m waiting for you to find me !

258
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,880
Country of Schuilu

259
00:15:59,040 --> 00:15:59,640
Teacher,

260
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,000
traveling in this rain

261
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,400
consumes a lot of spiritual energy

262
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,160
so it is a good training method.

263
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,360
Correct.

264
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:08,760
If you remain this diligent,

265
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,160
within 10 years,

266
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:11,760
you'll be Core Formation.

267
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,080
Teacher,

268
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,640
what cultivation level

269
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:17,040
do you think Ceng Niu has ?

270
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,480
Could he be

271
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:20,440
at the legendary Soul Transformation stage ?

272
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,760
This person's cultivation

273
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,280
should be Late stage Soul Formation,

274
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,240
not Soul Transformation.

275
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,720
Or else Red Butterfly

276
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,680
wouldn't just have lost an arm.

277
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,560
She would be dead.

