00:16:57,300 --> 00:19:30,030
Wang Lin's breakthrough had important context cut. Here is the novel for reference.\N\NHe lives, she dies… she lives, he dies…\NThis was another meaning of Life and Death. At this moment, Wang Lin suddenly understood something.\NThe words “To see a mountain as a mountain and see water as water” gained a new meaning to Wang Lin.\N\NSeeing life as life and seeing death as death was only the first layer of the Life and Death Domain.\NBack in the Four Sect Alliance, he saw the entire country be destroyed by Xue Yue. He saw the Soul Formation cultivator who gave him the feather die and staining Xue Yue with his blood. His heart shook. There was a sign of a breakthrough.\NLife and Death are separated by a thin line. Some are clearly dead, but they are now living in someone else’s heart. Some are clearly alive, but they start dying if they don’t change. Wang Lin’s eyes sparkled brighter and brighter.\NZhou Yi’s death caused Ting'er to live, but Ting'er’s death brought Zhou Yi life. Life and Death really did mess with people.\N\NHowever, the life and death of those two hadn’t ended; they now existed as a new life in the heart.\NSee life not as life and see death not as death. Wang Lin’s eyes were clear. He understood.\NHe seemed to have seen through the Life and Death Domain. His understanding of the Life and Death Domain rapidly increased. He took a deep breath. He knew that his cultivation was about to make a breakthrough.\N\N-> This is a buddhist concept, you start by seeing a mountain as a mountain. In the process of enlightment about Dharma (or the Dao here) you see the mountain not as a mountain but as something else entirely that does not exist on it's own, is interconnected with the world, ephemeral. Once enlightened you see once again the mountain as a mountain. But the mountain in the third step is very different from the first step thanks to the wisdom and enlightment of the second step.
